    {
      "text": "ON BLOCKS OF DELIGNE’S CATEGORY Rep(St) — We describe blocks in Deligne’s category Rep(St).\n\n**ON BLOCKS OF DELIGNE’S CATEGORY Rep(St)**\n\n*JONATHAN COMES AND VICTOR OSTRIK*\n\n43 pp, 27 sections.\n\n**Abstract.** We describe blocks in Deligne’s category Rep(St).\n\n**Outline.** Front matter; 1 Introduction; 1.1 Terminology and notation conventions; 2 The tensor category Rep(St); 2.1 Motivation; 2.2 Definition of Rep(St; F); 2.3.; 3 Indecomposable objects in Rep(St); 3.1 Classification of indecomposable objects o; 3.2 Lifting objects; 3.3 On Rep(St; F) for generic t; 3.4 The interpolation functor Rep(Sd; F)Rep(Sd; 3.5 Dimensions; 4 Endomorphisms of the identity functor; 4.1 Interpolating sums of r-cycles; 5 Blocks; 4.2 Frobenius' formula; 5.1 Blocks in additive categories",
